{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"57097783e0df5c3b428bb65dd9164cee1849209ea4396f4a672c8367e5bf25ae","digest":{"component_or_area":"reconciler backend interface specification (ADR 0035 §(d))","key_entities":["ADR 0035 §(d)","docs/adr/0035-reconciler-vendor-adapter-seam.md","RemoteRef","Backend","TicketTransport","OutboundMapper","InboundMapper","FieldSanitizer","IdentityConvention","SupportsLinks","SupportsComments","SupportsIncremental","outbound_fields.py","inbound_fields.py","inbound_translate.py","apply_inbound_records.py","config.reconciler.backend","FakeBackend","epic bbf1-82e1-cf9d-494a","epic be74-7832-03a8-48ac"],"problem_keywords":["ADR","reconciler","backend interface","protocol","seam","vendor adapter"],"propositions":["ADR 0035 §(d) must specify the concrete backend interface (Protocols and RemoteRef) to unblock Phase 2 implementation story decomposition and plan-review.","The backend interface shall use rebar's local ticket as the canonical model with no separate CanonicalTicket type; adapters translate vendor↔local via existing mappers.","Five role Protocols (TicketTransport, OutboundMapper, InboundMapper, FieldSanitizer, IdentityConvention) and optional capability Protocols must be named and defined behind a Backend facade.","RemoteRef{vendor, instance, remote_id} must replace hardcoded \"jira\" literals and bare jira_key identifiers in apply_inbound_records.py.","Three leak-fixes must be documented: ADF-sizing removed from differ, lossy-status/parent rules moved into adapter, duplicated value-maps/link-constants single-sourced."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TIC